tool.marquee.rect.description = Tōia he tīpakonga tapawhā hāngai. Mā Shift i te tīmatanga o te tō e tāpiri ki te tīpakonga, mā alt e tango, mā ngā mea e rua e whakawhiti; mā shift i te wā e tō ana e hanga tapawhā rite. Mā te pāwhiri kāore he tō e whakakore te tīpakonga.
